      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, I'd like at least a modicum of linux compatibility for the SDK so I can at LEAST upload from my Linux machine, having to swap back and forth to windows for in-game testing is really time consuming and annoying",
      "viewerReactions": null,
